        {
          "id": "03-03",
          "name": "UI: PolicyTestPanel component",
          "criteria": "PolicyTestPanel renders on policy detail page. JSON editor (CodeMirror, mode: json) for mock IntentEvaluationContext input. Test button calls POST /policies/:id/test. Result displays decision (allow/deny) with messages. Error states handled (400, 404, network).",
